# Agent Smith (Cursor)

- When creating or reviewing Cursor skills/rules, MUST load skill `agent-smith` and run its pre-completion verification.
- MUST NOT paste Copilot League `.agent.md` files into cursor-packs unchanged.
- If the target is pack-owned (repo-root `skills/` / `rules/` or symlink into `packs/shared`), MUST also follow skill `edit-cursor-packs`.
